 "title": "ERFVII and MynOx Regulation in Arabidopsis and MATα W303 cells",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the regulation of ERFVII and MynOx in Arabidopsis and MATα W303 cells. ERFVII protein RAP2.12 is a component of several modules, including 6TAL-VP64, GAL4STE12, and HRPE reporter. ERFVII regulates various genes, including PCO, PCO4, and HRG, and protects CIPK12. MynOx contains PCO and has output HRG, and its presence is associated with PCO4. The cluster also includes the degradation of UbSYRAP by PCO1 and PCO4 module, and the binding of UbSYRAP to HRPE1, HRPE2, and HRPEADH-NLUC.",
